---
title: "Sponsors & Sponsorship"
layout: page.njk
section: volunteers
description: "Meet our sponsors and learn how your business can support youth soccer in the Pasadena area."
---

{# ── Current sponsors ─────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<div class="mb-12">
  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-brand-red border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 mb-6">Our Sponsors</h2>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-10">
    {% for s in sponsors.current %}
    <a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
       class="opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
       title="{{ s.name }}">
      <img src="/images/{{ s.logo }}"
           alt="{{ s.name }}"
           class="h-12 w-auto max-w-[160px] object-contain">
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% if sponsors.inKind.length %}
  <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-4">In-kind partners</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8">
      {% for s in sponsors.inKind %}
      <a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity grayscale hover:grayscale-0"
         title="{{ s.name }}">
        <img src="/images/{{ s.logo }}"
             alt="{{ s.name }}"
             class="h-7 w-auto max-w-[110px] object-contain">
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

{# ── Become a sponsor ─────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-brand-red border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 mb-6">Become a Sponsor</h2>

<p class="mb-6 text-gray-700">
  AYSO Region 13 serves over 1,500 players ages 4–19 in Pasadena, Altadena, La Cañada, and surrounding communities.
  Sponsorship helps keep registration affordable and funds equipment, field maintenance, and programs.
  All donations are tax-deductible — we are a 501(c)(3) nonprofit.
</p>

{# Tier cards #}
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10">
  {% for tier in sponsors.tiers %}
  <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2">
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">{{ tier.name }}</h3>
      <span class="text-brand-red font-bold text-sm">{{ tier.amount }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">{{ tier.description }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

{# How to sponsor #}
<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-brand-red border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 mb-6">How to Contribute</h2>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">
  <div>
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Online</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Donate securely via InLeague.</p>
    <a href="https://ayso13.inleague.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
       class="btn-primary text-sm py-2 px-4">Donate Online</a>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">By Mail</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
      AYSO Region 13<br>
      711 W Woodbury Rd Unit E<br>
      Altadena, CA 91001
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
  Questions?
  <a href="mailto:info@ayso13.org" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">info@ayso13.org</a>
  &nbsp;·&nbsp; 626-316-6900
</p>
